<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><gpx version="1.1" creator="The Gunks Gravel Escape" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>Awosting Falls &amp; Lake Minnewaska</name><desc>30.1 mi and about 2,700 ft of climbing. At the state park drive after Awosting Falls, follow orange Scenic Sunset to Lake Minnewaska. Circle the lake and return to Lyons Road for the same ride to the inn. Saves 15.2 mi.</desc><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>OpenStreetMap linework</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Bike-Map-2024.pdf"><text>Designated ridge bicycle routes</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/where/new-york/shawangunks/river-to-ridge-trail"><text>River-to-Ridge map</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonk.com/recreation-activities/mountain-biking/"><text>Mountain House carriage roads</text></link><link href="https://www.openspaceinstitute.org/news/lake-awosting-restoration"><text>Lake Awosting loop reopening</text></link><link href="https://parks.ny.gov/visit/state-parks/minnewaska-state-park-preserve"><text>Minnewaska map and cycling conditions</text></link><link href="https://www.mohonkpreserve.org/plan-your-visit/"><text>Cycling day pass and hours</text></link><link href="https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?lat=41.736&amp;lon=-74.197"><text>Current point forecast</text></link><link href="https://511ny.org/"><text>Road incidents and traffic</text></link><link href="https://www.dot.ny.gov/divisions/engineering/technical-services/hds-respository/NYSDOT_2025_LHI_Local_Roads_and_Streets_Ulster_County.pdf"><text>Local road surfaces</text></link><link href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"><text>How the ride was measured</text></link><link href="https://data.usgs.gov/datacatalog/data/USGS%3A3a81321b-c153-416f-98b7-cc8e5f0e17c3"><text>Elevation estimates</text></link></metadata><wpt lat="41.739953" lon="-74.097332"><name>1. Locust Lane · car staging</name><desc>Choose an unsigned legal midblock curb space on the town street. Keep driveways and hydrants clear and check temporary signs and snow restrictions. Ride northwest to Plains Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.740286" lon="-74.097618"><name>2. Plains Road · turn right</name><desc>Turn right toward New Paltz. Follow Plains Road across the short bridge to the marked rail-trail junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.743053" lon="-74.092204"><name>3. Plains Road · rail-trail turn</name><desc>Turn left from Plains Road onto the Wallkill Valley Rail Trail toward the village. Watch approaching vehicles while making the turn.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745931" lon="-74.089818"><name>4. Water Street crossing</name><desc>Walk across Water Street at the marked crossing and continue straight on the paved rail trail.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746707" lon="-74.089261"><name>5. Main Street / NY 299 crossing</name><desc>Walk across the marked unsignalized crossing to the north sidewalk. Turn left and walk west toward the river bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"><name>6. Water Street Market · New Paltz</name><desc>Leave the rail trail here. Walk west on the village sidewalk and marked crossing to the separated sidepath on the river bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"><name>7. Carmine Liberta Bridge</name><desc>Use the separated bridge path. At its west end turn north beside the river towards Springtown Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.750376" lon="-74.095296"><name>8. Springtown Road crossing</name><desc>Cross the paved road and continue into the fields on River-to-Ridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.748664" lon="-74.109195"><name>9. Northern field loop</name><desc>Take the northern branch through the open fields toward Butterville Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.752119" lon="-74.123434"><name>10. Butterville Road crossing</name><desc>Cross Butterville Road and stay on the signed trail toward the foot of the ridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751247" lon="-74.124877"><name>11. Pine Road crossing</name><desc>Cross Pine Road on River-to-Ridge. Follow posted construction directions.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>12. Foothills / Testimonial Gateway</name><desc>First go east on Lenape Lane, through the Pin Oak Allée, to reach the entrance for your pass.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.744979" lon="-74.118505"><name>13. Testimonial Gateway · day pass</name><desc>The track turns at the arch. Walk west about 200 ft, then south on the signed path to the trailhead booth. Get today’s cycling pass and sign the Mountain House waiver. Rejoin the track at the arch.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.745812" lon="-74.129735"><name>14. Foothills · up Lenape</name><desc>Continue west uphill on Lenape Lane toward Lower Duck Pond Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.754881" lon="-74.138625"><name>15. Lower Duck Pond Road</name><desc>Leave Lenape Lane for Lower Duck Pond Road at the four-way junction.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.753538" lon="-74.145161"><name>16. Duck Pond / Glory Hill</name><desc>Follow Glory Hill Road away from the pond toward the ridge. Keep bikes on the carriage road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.751899" lon="-74.150745"><name>17. Glory Hill / Oakwood</name><desc>Cross the Oakwood Drive junction, continuing up Glory Hill toward Old Stage Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.754374" lon="-74.151362"><name>18. Old Stage Road</name><desc>Turn north on Old Stage Road and climb to Forest Drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.761551" lon="-74.154425"><name>19. Forest Drive / Home Farm</name><desc>Head toward Home Farm Circle; follow Home Farm Drive onto Old Minnewaska Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.759265" lon="-74.158906"><name>20. Long Woodland Drive</name><desc>Turn onto Long Woodland Drive, then follow Humpty Dumpty Road toward Copes Lookout Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764678" lon="-74.163315"><name>21. Copes Lookout Road spur</name><desc>For the signed lookout road take the spur. Return to this junction for Laurel Ledge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.767899" lon="-74.157398"><name>22. Copes Lookout Road turnaround</name><desc>Turn back at the end of the bicycle carriage road. Hotel and lakeshore access are separate.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.764766" lon="-74.163402"><name>23. Laurel Ledge</name><desc>Take Laurel Ledge Road to Rhododendron Bridge.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.758328" lon="-74.165507"><name>24. Overcliff Road</name><desc>At the bridge junction take Overcliff Road west toward Trapps Bridge and the Clove Valley views.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.737013" lon="-74.194011"><name>25. Trapps Bridge · to Lyons Road</name><desc>Cross above US 44/NY 55 on Trapps Bridge. Follow the carriage road west to the Lyons Road crossing, then continue toward Awosting Falls.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.73513" lon="-74.218834"><name>26. Lyons Road · first crossing</name><desc>Cross Lyons Road onto Awosting Falls Carriage Road for the falls and Lake Minnewaska. You return here after the lake loop.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734277" lon="-74.237454"><name>27. Awosting Falls</name><desc>Pause at the signed waterfall viewpoint and continue to the park drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734173" lon="-74.23863"><name>28. Park entrance drive · short and long routes split</name><desc>For Lake Minnewaska, walk across the paved entrance drive and take the orange Scenic Sunset Carriage Road uphill. The long route heads north over the park-drive bridge toward Lake Awosting.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.728068" lon="-74.237296"><name>29. Scenic Sunset / Lake Minnewaska</name><desc>Take the red Lake Minnewaska Carriage Road toward the west shore. Return to this junction after circling the lake.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.727451" lon="-74.238259"><name>30. West shore / Upper Awosting</name><desc>Stay on the red Lake Minnewaska Carriage Road along the west shore at the junction with Upper Awosting.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.725422" lon="-74.237643"><name>31. Castle Point junction · stay at the lake</name><desc>Keep to the red lake circuit as the blue Castle Point Carriage Road leaves uphill.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.721679" lon="-74.234603"><name>32. East shore / Millbrook Mountain</name><desc>Follow the red carriage road north along the eastern shore toward the visitor center.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.729441" lon="-74.235017"><name>33. Lake Minnewaska visitor-center junction</name><desc>Stay on the bicycle carriage-road link towards Scenic Sunset.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.728068" lon="-74.237296"><name>34. Scenic Sunset descent</name><desc>Leave the lake at Scenic Sunset Carriage Road, descending toward the state park entrance drive.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.734133" lon="-74.238627"><name>35. State park drive / Awosting Falls</name><desc>Walk across the park drive and follow Awosting Falls Carriage Road back to Lyons Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.73513" lon="-74.218834"><name>36. Lyons Road · leave the park</name><desc>The six-mile approach to the inn starts here. Coming back from Lake Minnewaska and Awosting Falls, turn left onto public Lyons Road east toward US 44/NY 55. The road is shared with cars from here to the overnight stop.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.735401" lon="-74.216099"><name>37. US 44 / NY 55 crossing</name><desc>Stop and check both directions. Cross the highway straight onto the local Trapps Road and descend toward Clove Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.7372" lon="-74.207313"><name>38. Clove Road bridge</name><desc>Continue over the small road bridge to the bend immediately beyond it.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.737042" lon="-74.207229"><name>39. Clove Road · follow the left bend</name><desc>Follow the sharp left bend on Clove Road toward the Coxing trailhead. Continue north on Clove Valley Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.786786" lon="-74.162151"><name>40. Clove Valley Road Extension</name><desc>Bear left onto Clove Valley Road Extension, toward County Route 6.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.790376" lon="-74.1639"><name>41. County Route 6 · turn left</name><desc>Turn left onto County Route 6. Follow the county road northwest past Rock Hill Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.795954" lon="-74.176049"><name>42. Berme Road junction</name><desc>Stay on the county road past Berme Road and Tow Path Road. Cross the Rondout on Kyserike Road.</desc></wpt><wpt lat="41.797085" lon="-74.178207"><name>43. Kyserike Road / Creek Road · overnight meeting point</name><desc>End at the public road junction near Crested Hen Farms. Follow the Studio host’s arrival instructions from here. Both day tracks meet at this junction.</desc></wpt><trk><name>Awosting Falls &amp; Lake Minnewaska</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.739953" lon="-74.097332"/><trkpt lat="41.740286" lon="-74.097618"/><trkpt lat="41.740399" lon="-74.097494"/><trkpt lat="41.740597" lon="-74.097279"/><trkpt lat="41.740705" lon="-74.097161"/><trkpt lat="41.741026" lon="-74.096771"/><trkpt lat="41.741302" lon="-74.096445"/><trkpt lat="41.741492" lon="-74.096199"/><trkpt lat="41.741533" lon="-74.096146"/><trkpt lat="41.741979" lon="-74.095568"/><trkpt lat="41.742228" lon="-74.095203"/><trkpt lat="41.742454" lon="-74.094838"/><trkpt lat="41.742656" lon="-74.094461"/><trkpt lat="41.742739" lon="-74.094285"/><trkpt lat="41.742805" lon="-74.094121"/><trkpt lat="41.742809" lon="-74.094108"/><trkpt lat="41.742907" lon="-74.093763"/><trkpt lat="41.742963" lon="-74.093502"/><trkpt lat="41.743002" lon="-74.09317"/><trkpt lat="41.743048" lon="-74.092599"/><trkpt lat="41.743054" lon="-74.092447"/><trkpt lat="41.743054" lon="-74.092306"/><trkpt lat="41.743053" lon="-74.092204"/><trkpt lat="41.743155" lon="-74.09212"/><trkpt lat="41.743562" lon="-74.091761"/><trkpt lat="41.744662" lon="-74.090787"/><trkpt lat="41.745044" lon="-74.090462"/><trkpt lat="41.745551" lon="-74.090101"/><trkpt lat="41.745792" lon="-74.089911"/><trkpt lat="41.745931" lon="-74.089818"/><trkpt lat="41.745977" lon="-74.089787"/><trkpt lat="41.746041" lon="-74.08974"/><trkpt lat="41.746707" lon="-74.089261"/><trkpt lat="41.746783" lon="-74.089214"/><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.089171"/><trkpt lat="41.746828" lon="-74.08925"/><trkpt lat="41.74671" lon="-74.089777"/><trkpt lat="41.746701" lon="-74.089844"/><trkpt lat="41.746712" lon="-74.089882"/><trkpt lat="41.746716" lon="-74.089991"/><trkpt lat="41.746718" lon="-74.090071"/><trkpt lat="41.746721" lon="-74.090085"/><trkpt lat="41.746744" lon="-74.090217"/><trkpt lat="41.746844" lon="-74.090867"/><trkpt lat="41.74685" lon="-74.090895"/><trkpt lat="41.746864" lon="-74.090922"/><trkpt lat="41.746887" lon="-74.090954"/><trkpt lat="41.746904" lon="-74.090987"/><trkpt lat="41.746922" lon="-74.091036"/><trkpt lat="41.746961" lon="-74.091164"/><trkpt lat="41.746986" lon="-74.091234"/><trkpt lat="41.747025" lon="-74.091338"/><trkpt lat="41.747113" lon="-74.091546"/><trkpt lat="41.747177" lon="-74.091711"/><trkpt lat="41.747217" lon="-74.091796"/><trkpt lat="41.747276" lon="-74.091867"/><trkpt lat="41.747336" lon="-74.091901"/><trkpt lat="41.747384" lon="-74.091897"/><trkpt lat="41.747419" lon="-74.091876"/><trkpt lat="41.747451" lon="-74.091842"/><trkpt lat="41.747476" lon="-74.091798"/><trkpt lat="41.747512" lon="-74.091685"/><trkpt lat="41.74753" lon="-74.091554"/><trkpt lat="41.747535" lon="-74.09147"/><trkpt lat="41.747537" lon="-74.091318"/><trkpt lat="41.747549" lon="-74.091211"/><trkpt lat="41.747582" lon="-74.091115"/><trkpt lat="41.747661" lon="-74.091015"/><trkpt lat="41.747718" lon="-74.090967"/><trkpt lat="41.74777" lon="-74.09095"/><trkpt lat="41.74782" lon="-74.090932"/><trkpt lat="41.747961" lon="-74.090887"/><trkpt lat="41.748184" lon="-74.090831"/><trkpt lat="41.748349" lon="-74.090797"/><trkpt lat="41.748545" lon="-74.090775"/><trkpt lat="41.748794" lon="-74.090756"/><trkpt lat="41.74891" lon="-74.09075"/><trkpt lat="41.749156" lon="-74.090745"/><trkpt lat="41.749335" lon="-74.090751"/><trkpt lat="41.749461" lon="-74.090768"/><trkpt lat="41.749643" lon="-74.090798"/><trkpt lat="41.750003" lon="-74.09086"/><trkpt lat="41.750249" lon="-74.090947"/><trkpt lat="41.750331" lon=